      {
        "id": "tb-addpolyn",
        "moduleId": "addpolyn-walkthrough",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "code",
        "title": "算法 2.22：AddPolyn",
        "markdown": "算法 2.22 直接实现了上述三路比较：\n\n```c\nvoid AddPolyn (polynomial &Pa, polynomial &Pb) {\n    ha = GetHead(Pa); hb = GetHead(Pb);\n    qa = NextPos(Pa,ha); qb = NextPos(Pb,hb);\n    while (qa && qb) {\n        a = GetCurElem(qa); b = GetCurElem(qb);\n        switch (*cmp(a,b)) {\n        case -1: ha = qa; qa = NextPos(Pa,qa); break;\n        case 0:\n            sum = a.coef + b.coef;\n            if (sum != 0.0) { SetCurElem(qa,sum); ha = qa; }\n            else { DelFirst(ha,qa); FreeNode(qa); }\n            DelFirst(hb,qb); FreeNode(qb); qb = NextPos(Pb,hb);\n            qa = NextPos(Pa,ha); break;\n        case 1:\n            DelFirst(hb,qb); InsFirst(ha,qb);\n            qb = NextPos(Pb,hb); ha = NextPos(Pa,ha); break;\n        }\n    }\n    if (!ListEmpty(Pb)) Append(Pa,qb);\n    FreeNode(hb);\n}\n```\n\n`ha`、`hb` 始终指向和链表及 Pb 的当前尾结点；`case 1` 把 `qb` 从 Pb 摘下再接到 Pa 尾部；循环结束后若 Pb 尚有剩余结点，用 `Append` 整体链接到 Pa，最后释放 Pb 的头结点。",
